{
  "title": "cee-exporter",
  "uid": "cee-exporter",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events received / sec",
      "description": "Delivery rate, not file activity. This counts event batches arriving from CEE; it does not count distinct filesystem operations, and nothing here deduplicates.\n\nCEE redelivers an event it cannot retire, at the heartbeat interval, forever. Measured on this estate: one event from 2026-08-14 20:35:21, byte-identical on every delivery — same path, same timeStamp, same inode — six deliveries in 65 seconds alongside seven heartbeats. That is not throughput, and the consumer cannot tell the difference: an empty HTTP 200 is the whole acknowledgement CEE expects for an event batch (its binaries carry no CheckEventResponse literal at all), so a replay is indistinguishable from real traffic at the wire.\n\nRead it with Events per heartbeat: a value pinned at 1.00 means every delivery is arriving on the heartbeat clock, which is the replay shape.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cee-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cee_events_received_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Since last event",
      "description": "Age of the newest event processed. This is the tile that makes a zero event rate readable: 0 evt/s next to \"18 min\" is a quiet estate, 0 evt/s next to hours is a dead pipeline, and the rate alone cannot tell you which.\n\nShows no value when nothing has been processed yet, rather than a 56-year age from a zero timestamp. Amber past 15 minutes and red past an hour are placeholders — set them to whatever counts as suspicious quiet on your estate, which on a busy NAS is far shorter.\n\nPer exporter instance, and it resets when the exporter does. \"no events yet\" immediately after a restart is accurate — this process has seen none — even while the chart below still shows history Prometheus retained from the previous run.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cee-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - (sum(cee_last_event_unix_seconds) > 0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "no events yet",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 900
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3600
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Events by type and protocol",
      "description": "What kind of activity is arriving, not just how much. The scalar counter collapsed the whole estate into one number, which is why a single replayed event was indistinguishable from varied traffic.\n\nOn 2026-08-11 this resolved to exactly one series — CEPP_CREATE_FILE · NFS — and that WAS the finding: a real filesystem produces opens, reads, closes and deletes, not one event type forever. On 2026-08-22 the same panel draws several CIFS types (CEPP_CLOSE_MODIFIED, CEPP_CREATE_DIRECTORY, CEPP_CREATE_FILE and more), which is what varied traffic looks like — so read the series count, not a fixed expectation.\n\nCounts deliveries, not distinct operations. Protocol comes from the wire's numeric code as ProtocolDesc resolves it (0 CIFS, 1 NFS, 2 FTP, 3 Unknown); an unmapped code renders Unknown rather than blank, so new traffic cannot hide in an empty label.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cee-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (event_type, protocol) (rate(cee_events_by_type_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{event_type}} · {{protocol}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "More metrics",
      "gridPos": {
